flowchart LR
    TED[TED Search API] --> CRAWLER
    CF[Contracts Finder OCDS] --> CRAWLER

    subgraph APP[Один Python package / один Docker image]
        CRAWLER[crawler role\nadapters + persistence + files]
        INDEXER[indexer role\nextract + chunk + embed]
        API[api role\nFastAPI + auth + limiter + RAG]
    end

    CRAWLER -->|metadata| PG[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    CRAWLER -->|attachments| VOL[(Docker volume)]
    CRAWLER -->|tender.changed.v1| NATS[(NATS JetStream)]
    NATS -->|durable pull / explicit ACK| INDEXER
    INDEXER -->|read| PG
    INDEXER -->|read| VOL
    INDEXER -->|batch embeddings| AI[AI provider\nOllama / MWS]
    INDEXER -->|chunks + vectors| PG
    API -->|exact cosine search| PG
    API -->|embed + generate| AI
    BROWSER[Static HTML/CSS/JS] -->|HTTP + X-API-Key| API
